#: ospy/templates/sensor.html:940
msgid ""
"To connect 16 pcs of humidity probes, it is necessary to connect 4 pcs of "
"the ADS1115 circuit to the IIC bus to the multisensor board (1 pc always for "
"4 A/D inputs). Each ADS1115 circuit has its own IIC address set (0x48, 0x49, "
"0x4A, 0x4B)."
msgstr ""
"Na pripojenie 16 ks senzorov vlhkosti pôdy je potrebné pripojiť 4 ks obvodu "
"ADS1115 na zbernicu IIC na dosku multisenzora (1 ks vždy pre 4 A/D vstupy). "
"Každý obvod ADS1115 má svoju vlastnú sadu adries IIC (0x48, 0x49, 0x4A, "
"0x4B)."

