#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This MQTT plugin adds an MQTT client to the OSPy daemon for other plugins "
#| "to use to publish information and or receive commands over MQTT. On this "
#| "page, the shared client is configured. Having a shared MQTT client "
#| "simplifies configuration and lowers overhead on the OSPy process, network "
#| "and broker. This plugin needs paho-mqtt. If not installed paho-mqtt, "
#| "plugin installs paho-mqtt in to the system himself. On first use (if run "
#| "installation paho-mqtt) please wait for status. We can use a public "
#| "Broker server to test http://www.hivemq.com/demos/websocket-client/."
msgid ""
"This MQTT plugin adds an MQTT client to the OSPy daemon for other plugins to "
"use to publish information and or receive commands over MQTT. On this page, "
"the shared client is configured. Having a shared MQTT client simplifies "
"configuration and lowers overhead on the OSPy process, network and broker. "
"This plugin needs paho-mqtt. On Raspberry Pi OS Bookworm and newer, install "
"it from apt with sudo apt install python3-paho-mqtt, or use the Install "
"libraries button when it is shown in settings. We can use a public Broker "
"server to test http://www.hivemq.com/demos/websocket-client/."
msgstr ""
"Tento zásuvný modul MQTT pridáva klienta MQTT do démona OSPy pre ostatné "
"zásuvné moduly, ktoré môžu používať na publikovanie informácií alebo "
"prijímanie príkazov cez MQTT. Na tejto stránke je nakonfigurovaný zdieľaný "
"klient. Zdieľaný klient MQTT zjednodušuje konfiguráciu a znižuje réžiu "
"procesu OSPy, siete a brokera. Tento doplnok potrebuje paho-mqtt. Ak nie je "
"nainštalovaný paho-mqtt, plugin nainštaluje paho-mqtt do systému sám. Pri "
"prvom použití (ak spustíte inštaláciu paho-mqtt) počkajte na stav. Na "
"testovanie môžeme použiť verejný Broker server http://www.hivemq.com/demos/"
"websocket-client/."

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:15
msgid "* MQTT manual control"
msgstr "MQTT ručné ovládanie"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:17
msgid ""
"The MQTT plugin allows multiple secondary OSPy controlers to be running with "
"the control OSPy system running. This means that one OSPy system can act as "
"the control driver for secondary systems that also use OSPy and have the "
"mqtt plugin installed. The control OSPy sends a list containing the on/off "
"states of all stations. The secondary system receives the list and checks "
"whether it is necessary to switch on one of its stations or switch it off "
"and make the necessary changes. All irrigation plans are set on the main "
"system and it records all running stations as if they were on the OSPy "
"control system itself. There is no feedback from the secondary  OSPy, so the "
"control system assumes that all stations are working as they should. If "
"enabled logging in secondary OSPy, stations running on this secondary OSPy "
"are also stored in the log. This provides a way to check if the station on "
"the secondary is working properly. You must this OSPy switch to manual mode! "
"MQTT core is required for this feature."
msgstr ""
"Doplnok MQTT umožňuje spustenie viacerých sekundárnych ovládačov OSPy so "
"spusteným riadiacim systémom OSPy. To znamená, že jeden systém OSPy môže "
"fungovať ako riadiaci ovládač pre sekundárne systémy, ktoré tiež používajú "
"OSPy a majú nainštalovaný doplnok mqtt. Riadiaci OSPy posiela zoznam so "
"stavmi zapnutia/vypnutia všetkých staníc. Sekundárny systém prijme zoznam a "
"skontroluje, či je potrebné niektorú z jeho staníc zapnúť alebo vypnúť a "
"vykonať potrebné zmeny. Všetky závlahové plány sú nastavené na hlavnom "
"systéme a zaznamenáva všetky bežiace stanice, ako keby boli na samotnom "
"riadiacom systéme OSPy. Neexistuje žiadna spätná väzba zo sekundárneho OSPy, "
"takže riadiaci systém predpokladá, že všetky stanice fungujú tak, ako majú. "
"Ak je povolené protokolovanie v sekundárnom OSPy, do protokolu sa ukladajú "
"aj stanice bežiace na tomto sekundárnom OSPy. Toto poskytuje spôsob, ako "
"skontrolovať, či stanica na sekundárnom zariadení funguje správne. Tento "
"OSPy musíte prepnúť do manuálneho režimu! Pre túto funkciu je potrebné jadro "
"MQTT."

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:20
msgid "* MQTT zones state"
msgstr "* MQTT stav stanic"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:22
msgid ""
"Status of all stations will be sent to the given topic. MQTT core is "
"required for this feature. Example: [{\"station\": 0, \"status\": \"off\", "
"\"name\": \"Station 01\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 1, \"status\": "
"\"off\", \"name\": \"Station 02\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 2, "
"\"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 03\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station"
"\": 3, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 04\", \"reason\": \"\"}, "
"{\"station\": 4, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 05\", \"reason\": "
"\"\"}, {\"station\": 5, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 06\", "
"\"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 6, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station "
"07\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 7, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": "
"\"Station 08\", \"reason\": \"\"}]"
msgstr ""
"Stav všetkých staníc bude odoslaný k danej téme. Pre túto funkciu je "
"potrebné jadro MQTT. Príklad: [{\"station\": 0, \"status\": \"off\", \"name"
"\": \"Station 01\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 1, \"status\": \"off\", "
"\"name\": \"Station 02\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 2, \"status\": "
"\"off\", \"name\": \"Station 03\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 3, "
"\"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 04\", \"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station"
"\": 4, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 05\", \"reason\": \"\"}, "
"{\"station\": 5, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 06\", \"reason\": "
"\"\"}, {\"station\": 6, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station 07\",  "
"\"reason\": \"\"}, {\"station\": 7, \"status\": \"off\", \"name\": \"Station "
"08\", \"reason\": \"\"}]"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:25
msgid "* MQTT run-once"
msgstr "* MQTT jednorázově"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:27
msgid ""
"will be received from the given topic for commands to start stations. MQTT "
"core is required for this feature. The received message is a sheet that "
"contains list or dict (station number, time in seconds.) Note: the list or "
"dict must be as long as the number of stations. Otherwise, the processing "
"will not take place! We can use a dictionary or list for control. The list "
"is simpler than the dictionary (we do not have to change it in the commands "
"every time we change the name of a station. You must this OSPy switch to "
"scheduler mode!"
msgstr ""
"budú z danej témy prijímané príkazy na spustenie staníc. Pre túto funkciu je "
"potrebné jadro MQTT. Prijatá správa je list, ktorý obsahuje zoznam alebo "
"slovník(číslo stanice, čas v sekundách.) Poznámka: zoznam alebo slovník musí "
"byť taký dlhý ako počet staníc. V opačnom prípade sa spracovanie "
"neuskutoční! Na ovládanie môžeme použiť slovník alebo zoznam. Zoznam je "
"jednoduchší ako slovník (nemusíme ho meniť v príkazoch pri každej zmene "
"názvu stanice. Pre jednorázové ovládanie musíte OSPy prepnúť do režimu "
"plánovača!"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:30
msgid "* MQTT get values"
msgstr "* MQTT čítanie hodnôt"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:32
msgid ""
"The status of the system settings will be sent to the given topic (cpu "
"temperature, manual mode, scheduler enabled...) This list is sent whenever "
"there is a change in the system. Example: {\"cpu_temp\": \"47.1\", "
"\"temp_unit\": \"C\", \"manual_mode\": true, \"scheduler_enabled\": true, "
"\"system_name\": \"Test VIP2\", \"output_count\": 8, \"rain_sensed\": false, "
"\"rain_block\": 0, \"level_adjustment\": 1.0, \"ospy_version\": \"3.0.58\", "
"\"release_date\": \"2023-08-13\", \"uptime\": \"3. day 05:38\"}"
msgstr ""
"Na danú tému sa odošle stav nastavenia systému (teplota procesora, manuálny "
"režim, zapnutý plánovač...) Tento zoznam sa posiela vždy, keď dôjde k zmene "
"v systéme. Príklad: {\"cpu_temp\": \"47.1\", \"temp_unit\": \"C\", "
"\"manual_mode\": true, \"scheduler_enabled\": true, \"system_name\": \"Test "
"VIP2\", \"output_count\": 8, \"rain_sensed\": false, \"rain_block\": 0, "
"\"level_adjustment.\":8.\":8. \"release_date\": \"2023-08-13\", \"uptime\": "
"\"3. deň 05:38\"}"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:34
msgid ""
"Example of settings for two OSPy systems (main OSPy and more secondary OSPy.)"
msgstr ""
"Príklad nastavení pre dva systémy OSPy (hlavné OSPy a ďalšie sekundárne "
"OSPy.)"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:36
msgid "OSPy main system"
msgstr "OSPy hlavný systém"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:38
msgid ""
"There are a total of 8 physical stations on the control OSPy system. We want "
"to control another secondary OSPy system, which also has 8 physical "
"stations. On the control OSPy system, set a total of 16 stations in the "
"settings tab. The scheduler will control all 16 stations through the set "
"programs. Run the \"MQTT\" plugin on the control OSPy system and set it "
"(server, user, password, port) for connection to MQTT server (message "
"broker). Manual MQTT control will not be used on the OSPy controller! Next, "
"check \"MQTT Use zones\" for sharing stations status."
msgstr ""
"Na riadiacom systéme OSPy je celkovo 8 fyzických staníc. Chceme ovládať "
"ďalší sekundárny systém OSPy, ktorý má tiež 8 fyzických staníc. Na ovládacom "
"systéme OSPy si v záložke nastavení nastavte spolu 16 staníc. Plánovač bude "
"ovládať všetkých 16 staníc cez nastavené programy. Spustite plugin \"MQTT\" "
"na riadiacom systéme OSPy a nastavte ho (server, používateľ, heslo, port) na "
"pripojenie k serveru MQTT (sprostredkovateľ správ). Manuálne ovládanie MQTT "
"sa na ovládači OSPy nepoužije! Ďalej skontrolujte „MQTT Use zones“ pre "
"zdieľanie stavu staníc."

