msgid ""
"Example: \"Pre station run time\" = 10 sec, \"Run time\" = max 10 seconds!"
msgstr ""
"Príklad: \"Doba behu pred stanicou\" = 10 sekúnd, \"Doba behu\" = max. 10 "
"sekúnd!"

